..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : FTEXTEDITOR.CONVERT2HTML
.. Author         : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : fwester
.. Kontrolle      : lei
.. Functionality  : Converts file given in xsrcfile into HTML. Breaks with
.. error, if filename is missed, file does not exists or convert fails.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Declarations
.type DVMI2 xsrcfile ? _F|defined(U|xsrcfile)
..
.continue ERROR01 ?  F|empty(U|xsrcfile)
.continue ERROR02 ? _F|fileexists(U|xsrcfile)
..
.. Convert
.input java:de.abas.print.utilities.HtmlFreeTextConverter@de.abas.erp.print 'F|formatstr("freeTextFile={1}", U|xsrcfile)'
.continue ERROR03 ? _F|empty(G|status)
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
..*****************************************************************************
..
!ERROR01: Missing filename!
.error -message Dateiname fehlt!
.end 1
..
!ERROR02: Missing file!
.error -message Datei nicht gefunden!
.end 1
..
!ERROR03: Convert failed!
.error -message Das Konvertieren des Freitextes ist gescheitert!
.end 1
